+Security Critical: no
+Shipped: yes
+
+Description:
+The deterministic tab group naming rule from Ardia's
+apps/browser/src/store/groupNames.ts (autoGroupName, siteName, siteKey).
+
+Local Modifications:
+Rewritten in C++ by the rac Authors. The host's name comes from Chromium's
+public suffix list (registry_controlled_domains), with Ardia's label-length
+guess kept as the fallback.
