+// Copyright 2026 The rac Authors
+// You can use, redistribute, and/or modify this source code under
+// the terms of the GPL-3.0 license that can be found in the LICENSE file.
+
+// Derived from Stedding's CleanLink at
+// https://github.com/ysalitrynskyi/stedding-browser, commit
+// f301a37ce926c042d56ce115abb2b7517a8300f7, changed by the rac Authors.
+// Stedding's licence follows.
